<section class="review-section" id="overview">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Overview</h2>
<p>Splunk IT Service Intelligence (ITSI) is an enterprise-grade AIOps solution that uses machine learning for predictive analytics, event correlation, and service-level monitoring. Now part of Cisco after the 2023 acquisition, Splunk excels at processing massive volumes of machine data.</p>
<p>ITSI builds on Splunk's legendary log analysis capabilities to provide service-centric views of IT operations. It correlates events across infrastructure, applications, and security to identify issues before they impact business services.</p>
<p>The platform is particularly strong in complex enterprise environments with heterogeneous infrastructure and high data volumes. Its Machine Learning Toolkit enables custom ML models for predictive alerting.</p>
</section>
